{"id":"088f0b71a9b22ef9","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-bm-second-player.md","title":"原书 BM 括号等价的反例","display":"ex-bm-second-player — 原书 BM 括号等价的反例","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-bm-second-player","aliases":["20-ex-bm-second-player"],"display":"ex-bm-second-player — 原书 BM 括号等价的反例","chapter":"14","section":"14.1","source_kind":"source-correction","verification_status":"corrected-counterexample","source_reference":"本地反例；针对 Theorem 14.1.3 的括号断言","source_pdf_pages":[241,242],"source_printed_pages":[212,213],"depends_on":["[[20-df-bm-game]]","[[20-df-bm-strategy]]","[[20-df-category]]","[[20-thm-baire-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-bm-second-player"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-bm-second-player</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-bm-second-player — 原书 BM 括号等价的反例"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-correction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"corrected-counterexample"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"本地反例；针对 Theorem 14.1.3 的括号断言"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>241</span><span>242</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>212</span><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f02918e259cd9a8e\" href=\"?note=f02918e259cd9a8e\" title=\"20-df-bm-game\">20-df-bm-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dbd3c82cd2473f13\" href=\"?note=dbd3c82cd2473f13\" title=\"20-df-bm-strategy\">20-df-bm-strategy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"249ce19d50d1f381\" href=\"?note=249ce19d50d1f381\" title=\"20-thm-baire-category\">20-thm-baire-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=[(0)]\">\\(A=[(0)]\\)</span> 是首位为 0 的基本开柱。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f02918e259cd9a8e\" href=\"?note=f02918e259cd9a8e\" title=\"20-df-bm-game\">20-df-bm-game</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dbd3c82cd2473f13\" href=\"?note=dbd3c82cd2473f13\" title=\"20-df-bm-strategy\">20-df-bm-strategy</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"249ce19d50d1f381\" href=\"?note=249ce19d50d1f381\" title=\"20-thm-baire-category\">20-thm-baire-category</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}bm\\text{-}second\\text{-}player}\\vdash\n\\neg\\operatorname{Meager}(A),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,II}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}bm\\text{-}second\\text{-}player}\\vdash\n\\neg\\operatorname{Meager}(A),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,II}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>A 含一个非空开柱，因此不 meager；否则其补集 comeager，与该柱集不相交，违背 Baire 定理。II 第一步选择 (1)，随后任意严格延伸，最终首位始终为 1，保证 I 输。由此否定原书第 213 页括号中的“equivalently”。</p>\n<p>来源：本地反例；针对 Theorem 14.1.3 的括号断言；印刷页 212, 213；PDF 第 241, 242 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id